.TH QUIPU-AUDIT-INVENTORY 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-audit\-inventory \- List the policies the audit checks against
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu audit inventory\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the policies the audit checks against
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
